{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790299380, "covers_from": "2026-09-25T01:23:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-25T01:24:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790299440, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-25T01:23:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9815, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "停車空間太小少了 臨沂街路巷子裡路邊找車位要找100年", "display_name": "中正代表 No.9,815", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T01:23:09+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30187, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "南港每天早晚上下班塞車都將近兩個小時通勤 果然是無言城市", "display_name": "南港代表 No.30,187", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T01:23:18+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49164, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "請你在當選市長後全面檢討全台北市的人行道，能夠讓推輪椅的正常走在人行道上！這是非常重要的一件事。", "display_name": "信義代表 William（a bit-clay）", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T01:23:33+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16170, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "食安", "content": "請提升台北市營養午餐的費用吧!150至200元，請廢除免費制", "display_name": "大同代表 No.16,170", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T01:23:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44281, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "下班時間，承德幹線、288及282車次不約而同都要10幾20分鐘以上，每一班公車人都非多！太累人", "display_name": "松山代表 No.44,281", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 30187, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.30,187", "district": "nangang", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 49164, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "display_name": "信義代表 William（a bit-clay）", "dist